# Read by `mcpb pack` (the CLI never consults .gitignore): everything under
# mcpb/ that is not matched here or by mcpb's built-in patterns is archived
# into the bundle. These are local build artifacts that must never ship - a
# co-located uv.lock would pin the bundle to whatever version was last
# resolved here (0.4.0 once), .venv/pyvenv.cfg leaks the packer's home path,
# and dotenv files may hold real credentials.
uv.lock
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
.env.*
